// Fallback choice example
// Demonstrates how fallback choices work when all other choices have been used

You stand before three doors.

* [Open the red door]
    You open the red door and find a treasure chest!
    -> continue

* [Open the blue door]
    You open the blue door and discover a library full of ancient books.
    -> continue

* [Open the green door]
    You open the green door and step into a beautiful garden.
    -> continue

=== continue ===
You return to the hallway.

-> END
